    <briefdescription>
<para>TODO: Might pack better if we changed this to a Struct of Arrays, since <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_operand" kindref="compound">MachineOperand</ref> is width 32, making this struct width 33. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>We could also potentially avoid storing the whole <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_operand" kindref="compound">MachineOperand</ref> (sizeof=32), instead choosing to store just the contents portion (sizeof=8) and a Kind enum, since we already know it is some type of immediate value. Stores a single debug operand, which can either be a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_operand" kindref="compound">MachineOperand</ref> for directly storing immediate values, or a <ref refid="class_live_debug_values_1_1_value_i_d_num" kindref="compound">ValueIDNum</ref> representing some value computed at some point in the program. IsConst is used as a discriminator. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
